        "TileImage": "$($repository 6f592c07-601b-4574-ba39-f6d397ba1a10).Image",
        "Description": "You, 47 Are Going To Paris In Which An Evil Situation Exists. These 3 People You Are Seeing Are 3 ICA Agents That Would Be Trying To Kill Dalia Morgolis. We Have To Protect Her, But It Would Not Be Easy. They Have A Plan and a Few Ways How To Kill Her, But That Would Not Happen Because You Are Going To Eliminate Them Before They Kill Her. Client Also Offers Extra Money If You Kill Them With Fiber Wire. Either Way No Bodies May Be Found Or Else An Evacuation Would Start. Good Luck, 47!",
